4:["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-slate prose-lg max-w-none prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:tracking-tight prose-h2:text-2xl prose-h2:mt-12 prose-h2:mb-4 prose-h3:text-xl prose-h3:mt-8 prose-h3:mb-3 prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-p:text-slate-600 prose-li:text-slate-600 prose-a:text-indigo-600 prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline prose-strong:text-slate-900","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"Holiday bingo is one of the easiest, most inclusive party games you can organize during the festive season. Whether it's a classroom Christmas party, family gathering, office holiday event, or virtual celebration, bingo brings everyone together. Here are 20+ creative holiday bingo ideas organized by occasion."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Christmas Party Bingo Ideas"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"1. Classic Christmas Bingo"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Fill squares with iconic Christmas symbols: Santa, reindeer, snowflakes, candy canes, Christmas tree, stockings, ornaments, gingerbread man, and more. This works for all ages and is especially great for kids."}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"2. Christmas Movie Bingo"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Watch a holiday movie together and mark squares when classic movie moments happen — \"someone says Merry Christmas,\" \"snow falls,\" \"a gift is opened,\" \"a character sings.\" Works with any Christmas movie from Home Alone to Elf."}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"3. Christmas Carol Bingo"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Feature song titles on cards. Play short clips of Christmas carols and guests mark the matching song. Who knew \"Jingle Bells\" vs. \"Jingle Bell Rock\" could cause such heated debates?"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"4. Ugly Sweater Bingo"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Perfect for ugly sweater parties. Squares feature sweater elements: \"has a reindeer,\" \"lights that actually work,\" \"3D elements,\" \"has a pun,\" \"features a cat.\" Guests mark squares as they spot sweaters matching each description."}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"5. Gift Exchange Bingo"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"During white elephant or Secret Santa exchanges, create bingo cards with predicted gift types: \"a candle,\" \"something handmade,\" \"a gag gift,\" \"a gift card,\" \"chocolate.\""}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Family Gathering Bingo"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"6. Family Traditions Bingo"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Feature your family's unique holiday traditions: \"Uncle Steve tells the same joke,\" \"Grandma asks about dating life,\" \"kids fight over dessert.\" Personalized and guaranteed to get laughs."}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"7. Holiday Dinner Bingo"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Squares feature dinner table moments: \"someone goes for seconds,\" \"a dish is complimented,\" \"someone falls asleep after eating,\" \"a recipe is requested.\""}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"8. Multi-Generational Bingo"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Design cards that work for grandparents and grandkids alike. Use large, clear text with simple holiday words and images. It's one of the rare games the whole family can genuinely play together."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Classroom Holiday Bingo"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"9. Holiday Vocabulary Bingo"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Feature holiday-themed vocabulary words. The teacher calls out definitions and students match the word. Educational and festive at the same time."}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"10. Winter Science Bingo"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Combine winter science concepts with bingo: \"snowflake,\" \"hibernation,\" \"solstice,\" \"frost,\" \"migration.\" Review winter science topics in a game format."}],"$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d"]}]
